{"id":"n29970-1-38","stage":1,"title":"어깨 · 肩","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29970-1-38-1","ko":"엄마. 가방이 너무 무거워서 어깨가 아파요.","zh":"妈妈，书包太重了，肩膀好疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"가방이","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방이","audio":"/audio/3bacd65ffcbf66c44b88.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"무거워서","meaning":"重，沉","explanation":"무겁다：重，沉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"1","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무거워서","audio":"/audio/83d32f38f21fba641c8b.mp3"}},{"text":"어깨가","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어깨가","audio":"/audio/74d892669cfa7ee39c34.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요.","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"91e3eab0a3ea6c9e","term":"무겁다","zh":"重，沉","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3","entryId":"58159","definition":"重量大。","pronunciation":["무겁따"]},{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d7528a951c1e983186f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29970-1-38-2","ko":"이리 오렴. 엄마가 어깨 주물러 줄게.","zh":"过来吧，妈妈帮你按按肩膀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}},{"text":"오렴.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오렴","audio":"/audio/f9b3a01212dfba987e09.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마가","audio":"/audio/2e1aa7412bb8a19dded5.mp3"}},{"text":"어깨","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}},{"text":"주물러","meaning":"揉，揉捏","explanation":"주무르다：揉，揉捏；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"주무르다","audio":"/audio/e4c9db12fe328c863d86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75174","senseId":"1","lemma":"주무르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주물러","audio":"/audio/306052a12f4ec3dc9343.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"e4c9db12fe328c86","term":"주무르다","zh":"揉，揉捏","audio":"/audio/e4c9db12fe328c863d86.mp3","entryId":"75174","definition":"用手将某个东西或身体反复握紧又放开，一直摆弄。","pronunciati